<title>DUBAI: Iran said producing oil from 47 fields.</title>
<headline>Iran said producing oil from 47 fields.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC-member Iran is producing oil from 47 oilfields, an Iranian newspaper reported on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;At present Iran produces over 3.5 million barrels of oil (per day) from 47 oilfields,&quot; the English-language Tehran Times newspaper reported in a survey on the activities of the state's National Iranian Oil Company's (NIOC) onshore divison.</p>
<p>Gas output was put at over 25 million cubic meters a day.</p>
<p>Iran is the world's third largest oil exporter.</p>
</text>
